i:true/qt=q:1/ll=n:true 1280w, //img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/static/transparent_placeholder.png/:/rs=w:600,h:300,cg:true,m,i:true/qt=q:1/ll=n:true 1536w" sizes="(min-width: 451px) and (max-width: 767px) 767px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px) 1023px, (min-width: 1024px) and (max-width: 1279px) 1279px, (min-width: 1280px) and (max-width: 1535px) 1535px, (min-width: 1536px) 1536px" data-aid="ABOUT_IMAGE_RENDERED1" overlayAlpha="0" class="x-el x-el-img c1-1 c1-2 c1-4 c1-r c1-n c1-o c1-15 c1-16 c1-3c c1-7b c1-7c c1-7d c1-52 c1-b c1-c c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"/></picture></span></div></div><div data-ux="GridCell" class="x-el x-el-div c1-1 c1-2 c1-61 c1-69 c1-6a c1-73 c1-r c1-i c1-6c c1-j c1-6d c1-22 c1-27 c1-23 c1-b c1-c c1-77 c1-78 c1-6h c1-6i c1-6j c1-6k c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><div data-ux="ContentBasic" index="1" id="46bcb05d-4af0-41e4-a57a-97b10326ad6a" class="x-el x-el-div x-el c1-1 c1-2 c1-22 c1-39 c1-4 c1-7e c1-23 c1-11 c1-7f c1-7g c1-b c1-c c1-7h c1-7i c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g c1-1 c1-2 c1-b c1-c c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><h4 role="heading" aria-level="4" data-ux="ContentHeading" data-aid="ABOUT_HEADLINE_RENDERED1" data-typography="HeadingDelta" class="x-el x-el-h4 c1-1 c1-2 c1-12 c1-13 c1-7j c1-40 c1-41 c1-15 c1-16 c1-b c1-1i c1-1j c1-1k c1-1l c1-1m c1-1n c1-1o">Comodidad y Ambiente</h4><div data-ux="ContentText" alignment="center" data-aid="ABOUT_DESCRIPTION_RENDERED1" data-typography="BodyAlpha" class="x-el c1-1 c1-2 c1-12 c1-13 c1-14 c1-15 c1-16 c1-17 c1-18 c1-19 c1-1a c1-1b c1-1c c1-1d c1-1e c1-7k c1-7l c1-7m c1-7n c1-7o c1-7p c1-7q c1-7r c1-7s c1-7t c1-7u c1-7v c1-7w c1-7x c1-7y c1-7z c1-80 c1-81 c1-82 c1-83 c1-84 c1-85 c1-86 c1-87 c1-88 c1-89 c1-8a c1-8b c1-8c c1-8d c1-8e c1-8f c1-69 c1-b c1-8g c1-c c1-1k c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g x-rt"><p style="margin:0"><span>Tanto en los días calurosos de verano como en las frías jornadas de invierno, en Minigolf Sevilla siempre estarás cómodo. Nuestro local está completamente climatizado: fresco y agradable con aire acondicionado en verano, y cálido y acogedor cuando bajan las temperaturas.</span></p><p style="margin:0"><span>Pide un cóctel o una bebida fría en el bar y disfruta del ambiente animado mientras juegas. Desde un rato casual hasta una competición seria, Minigolf Sevilla es la actividad perfecta para todas las edades — y una de las cosas más originales que hacer en Sevilla, en cualquier época del año.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-ux="GridCell" class="x-el x-el-div c1-1 c1-2 c1-61 c1-69 c1-6a c1-73 c1-r c1-i c1-6c c1-74 c1-6d c1-b c1-c c1-6h c1-6i c1-75 c1-6k c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><div data-ux="Grid" class="x-el x-el-div c1-1 c1-2 c1-22 c1-61 c1-62 c1-5r c1-15 c1-63 c1-16 c1-64 c1-25 c1-b c1-c c1-65 c1-66 c1-67 c1-68 c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><div data-ux="GridCell" class="x-el x-el-div c1-1 c1-2 c1-61 c1-69 c1-6a c1-73 c1-r c1-i c1-6c c1-j c1-6d c1-76 c1-25 c1-b c1-c c1-77 c1-78 c1-6h c1-6i c1-6j c1-6k c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><div data-ux="Block" class="x-el x-el-div c1-1 c1-2 c1-79 c1-11 c1-b c1-c c1-d c1-7a c1-e c1-f c1-g"><span data-ux="Element" class="x-el x-el-span c1-1 c1-2 c1-b c1-c c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><picture data-lazyimg="true" class="x-el x-el-picture c1-1 c1-2 c1-4 c1-2y c1-11 c1-2u c1-50 c1-b c1-c c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><source media="(max-width: 450px)" data-lazyimg="true" data-srcsetlazy="//img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/e8828a72-2e79-4800-bc49-cdbc4672a786/GYG%206.jpg/:/cr=t:17.97%25,l:0%25,w:100%25,h:64.06%25/rs=w:403,h:202,cg:true, //img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/e8828a72-2e79-4800-bc49-cdbc4672a786/GYG%206.jpg/:/cr=t:17.97%25,l:0%25,w:100%25,h:64.06%25/rs=w:806,h:403,cg:true 2x, //img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/e8828a72-2e79-4800-bc49-cdbc4672a786/GYG%206.jpg/:/cr=t:17.97%25,l:0%25,w:100%25,h:64.06%25/rs=w:1209,h:605,cg:true 3x" srcSet="//img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/static/transparent_placeholder.png/:/rs=w:451,h:225,cg:true,m,i:true/qt=q:1/ll=n:true 451w, //img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/static/transparent_placeholder.png/:/rs=w:600,h:300,cg:true,m,i:true/qt=q:1/ll=n:true 768w, 