-srclazy="//img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/e8828a72-2e79-4800-bc49-cdbc4672a786/GYG%206.jpg/:/cr=t:17.97%25,l:0%25,w:100%25,h:64.06%25/rs=w:600,h:300,cg:true" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=" srcSet="//img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/static/transparent_placeholder.png/:/rs=w:451,h:225,cg:true,m,i:true/qt=q:1/ll=n:true 451w, //img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/static/transparent_placeholder.png/:/rs=w:600,h:300,cg:true,m,i:true/qt=q:1/ll=n:true 768w, //img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/static/transparent_placeholder.png/:/rs=w:600,h:300,cg:true,m,i:true/qt=q:1/ll=n:true 1024w, //img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/static/transparent_placeholder.png/:/rs=w:600,h:300,cg:true,m,i:true/qt=q:1/ll=n:true 1280w, //img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/static/transparent_placeholder.png/:/rs=w:600,h:300,cg:true,m,i:true/qt=q:1/ll=n:true 1536w" sizes="(min-width: 451px) and (max-width: 767px) 767px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px) 1023px, (min-width: 1024px) and (max-width: 1279px) 1279px, (min-width: 1280px) and (max-width: 1535px) 1535px, (min-width: 1536px) 1536px" data-aid="ABOUT_IMAGE_RENDERED2" overlayAlpha="0" class="x-el x-el-img c1-1 c1-2 c1-4 c1-r c1-n c1-o c1-15 c1-16 c1-3c c1-7b c1-7c c1-7d c1-52 c1-b c1-c c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"/></picture></span></div></div><div data-ux="GridCell" class="x-el x-el-div c1-1 c1-2 c1-61 c1-69 c1-6a c1-73 c1-r c1-i c1-6c c1-j c1-6d c1-22 c1-27 c1-23 c1-b c1-c c1-77 c1-78 c1-6h c1-6i c1-6j c1-6k c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><div data-ux="ContentBasic" index="2" id="031b5172-4956-47d2-ada2-5075cd0bb7bb" class="x-el x-el-div x-el c1-1 c1-2 c1-22 c1-39 c1-4 c1-7e c1-23 c1-11 c1-7f c1-7g c1-b c1-c c1-7h c1-7i c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g c1-1 c1-2 c1-b c1-c c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><h4 role="heading" aria-level="4" data-ux="ContentHeading" data-aid="ABOUT_HEADLINE_RENDERED2" data-typography="HeadingDelta" class="x-el x-el-h4 c1-1 c1-2 c1-12 c1-13 c1-7j c1-40 c1-41 c1-15 c1-16 c1-b c1-1i c1-1j c1-1k c1-1l c1-1m c1-1n c1-1o">La Ubicación Perfecta</h4><div data-ux="ContentText" alignment="center" data-aid="ABOUT_DESCRIPTION_RENDERED2" data-typography="BodyAlpha" class="x-el c1-1 c1-2 c1-12 c1-13 c1-14 c1-15 c1-16 c1-17 c1-18 c1-19 c1-1a c1-1b c1-1c c1-1d c1-1e c1-7k c1-7l c1-7m c1-7n c1-7o c1-7p c1-7q c1-7r c1-7s c1-7t c1-7u c1-7v c1-7w c1-7x c1-7y c1-7z c1-80 c1-81 c1-82 c1-83 c1-84 c1-85 c1-86 c1-87 c1-88 c1-89 c1-8a c1-8b c1-8c c1-8d c1-8e c1-8f c1-69 c1-b c1-8g c1-c c1-1k c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g x-rt"><p style="margin:0"><span>En pleno centro de la ciudad, a pocos minutos de Las Setas, Minigolf Sevilla es fácil de encontrar e imposible de olvidar. Abrimos todos los días y damos la bienvenida a particulares, familias y grupos.</span></p><p style="margin:0"><span>Ya sea que estés celebrando un cumpleaños, organizando un evento de empresa o simplemente buscando cosas divertidas que hacer en Sevilla, coronaremos a los ganadores y nos aseguraremos de que todos se lleven recuerdos (y fotos) para atesorar. Con nuestra ubicación céntrica y ambiente animado, Minigolf Sevilla es el plan perfecto para añadir a tu lista de actividades en Sevilla.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>  </div></div></div><div id="3a41d43f-de8c-46bd-897b-3f85cfde422d" class="widget widget-buttons widget-buttons-buttons-1"><div data-ux="Widget" role="region" id="3a41d43f-de8c-46bd-897b-3f85cfde422d" class="x-el x-el-div x-el c1-1 c1-2 c1-h c1-4y c1-7 c1-8 c1-9 c1-a c1-5v c1-5w c1-5x c1-b c1-c c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g c1-1 c1-2 c1-b c1-c c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><div> <section data-ux="Section" class="x-el x-el-section c1-1 c1-2 c1-h c1-31 c1-5y c1-b c1-c c1-5z c1-60 c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><div data-ux="Container" class="x-el x-el-div c1-1 c1-2 c1-n c1-o c1-p c1-q c1-r c1-b c1-c c1-s c1-d c1-t c1-e c1-w c1-f c1-x c1-g"><div data-ux="Grid" class="x-el x-el-div c1-1 c1-2 c1-22 c1-61 c1-62 c1-5r c1-15 c1-63 c1-16 c1-64 c1-b c1-c c1-65 c1-66 c1-67 c1-68 c1-d c1-e c1-f c1-g"><div data-ux="GridCell" class="x-el x-el-div c1-1 c1-2 c1-61 c1-69 c1-6a c1-6b c1-r c1-